@* Path: LedgerLink/Views/Home/Privacy.cshtml *@

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy & Terms of Service";
    var appName = "LedgerLink";
    var currentYear = DateTime.Now.Year;
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - @appName</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .privacy-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            color: #0056b3;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.8em;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        h3 {
            font-size: 1.4em;
        }
        p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        ul {
            list-style-type: disc;
            margin-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #d9534f;
        }
        .footer-text {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="privacy-container">
        <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
        <p class="text-center text-muted">Last Updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")</p>

        <p>Welcome to **@appName**, an innovative digital ledger and credit management application provided by **Your Shop**. We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of the data you entrust to our service. This Privacy Policy and Terms of Service outlines how we collect, use, protect, and manage your information.</p>

        <hr/>

        <h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>To provide our services, **@appName** collects and stores the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Shop Admin Data:</strong> Your username, password (securely hashed), and the name of your shop (**Your Shop**).</li>
            <li><strong>Customer Data:</strong> Full name, phone number, email address, physical address, and a unique QR/barcode ID for each of your customers.</li>
            <li><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> Details of product sales (product, quantity, unit price, total amount, purchase date, credit status, notes).</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Data:</strong> Records of payments received from customers (amount paid, payment date, payment mode).</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Non-personal information about how you interact with the application (e.g., login times, features accessed) for performance and improvement purposes.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr/>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>Your data is used exclusively to operate, maintain, and improve the **@appName** service for **Your Shop**:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>To manage customer credit accounts and track outstanding balances.</li>
            <li>To record and track product sales and customer payments.</li>
            <li>To generate unique QR/barcode IDs for customer identification.</li>
            <li>To send automated payment reminders via email (and SMS, if configured).</li>
            <li>To generate printable transaction and payment receipts.</li>
            <li>To provide an analytics dashboard for business insights.</li>
            <li>To ensure the security and integrity of the application.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr/>

        <h2>3. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p>All data is stored securely in a dedicated PostgreSQL database. We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the Internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your data, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.</p>

        <hr/>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p>**@appName** does not share, sell, rent, or trade your collected data with third parties for their marketing purposes. Data is only shared under the following circumstances:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>With Your Consent:</strong> If you explicitly authorize us to share specific data.</li>
            <li><strong>For Service Provision:</strong> With third-party service providers (e.g., email/SMS providers like SendGrid) strictly for the purpose of delivering the services you use (e.g., sending email reminders). These providers are bound by confidentiality agreements.</li>
            <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> If required by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr/>

        <h2>5. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
        <p>As the administrator of **@appName** for **Your Shop**, you have control over your data:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>You can add, edit, and delete customer and product information at any time.</li>
            <li>You can access transaction and payment history.</li>
            <li>For data deletion requests beyond the application's interface, please contact **Your Shop** directly.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr/>

        <h2>6. Terms of Service & Intellectual Property</h2>
        <h3>6.1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
        <p>By using **@appName**, you agree to be bound by these Privacy Policy and Terms of Service. If you do not agree, you may not use the application.</p>

        <h3>6.2. License to Use</h3>
        <p>**@appName** grants **Your Shop** a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the application for its internal business operations. This license does not permit sublicensing or redistribution of the application.</p>

        <h3>6.3. Intellectual Property (IP) Protection <span class="highlight">(Crucial for your project!)</span></h3>
        <p>All intellectual property rights in **@appName**, including but not limited to its code, design, features, and underlying technology, are owned by **Om Kapadiya** (the developer). This application is provided for your use under license and is not sold. You agree:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Not to copy, modify, adapt, translate, reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, or create derivative works from **@appName**.</li>
            <li>Not to attempt to discover the source code or algorithms of **@appName**.</li>
            <li>Not to distribute, sell, lease, rent, or otherwise transfer **@appName** or any of its components to third parties.</li>
            <li>Any unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution of **@appName** or its components is strictly prohibited and may result in legal action.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>6.4. Limitation of Liability</h3>
        <p>**@appName** is provided "as is" without any warranties. **Om Kapadiya** and **Your Shop** shall not be liable for any damages arising from the use or inability to use the application.</p>

        <hr/>

        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update our Privacy Policy and Terms of Service from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Policy on this page. You are advised to review this Policy periodically for any changes.</p>

        <hr/>

        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or Terms of Service, please contact **Your Shop** directly.</p>

        <div class="footer-text">
            <p>&copy; @currentYear Your Shop. All rights reserved. Powered by @appName.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>